  "body": "Add a shop air-cut test kit (`docs/tester-kits/brother-speedio/`) matching the layout of `docs/tester-kits/tormach-microarc-4th/README.md`.\n\n## Scope\n- Add `README.md` with pre-run checks for Brother CNC-C00/D00 (`G100` vs `M06` dry-run clearance, Z zero well above table, `G77` dry rigid tap check, `M298`/`M299` smoothing check, `M458`/`M494` coolant/air verification, and Tool Data offset check).\n- Add a small sample `.camproj` and its verified `.nc` output generated by `assets/posts/brother-speedio.cps` on `assets/machines/brother-s500x2.mch`.\n- Add a pinning test modeled on `crates/app/tests/microarc_test_part.rs` so the committed `.nc` stays in sync with the post.\n\nDone means: `docs/tester-kits/brother-speedio/` contains `README.md`, `.camproj`, and `.nc`, and the pinning test passes in `cargo test`.\n\nPart of #1960\n",
